;
; How Ramble indexes one envelope of the owner's Web4 feed in MYRA
; (ramble_rules.h RR2): its feed id (at most 4294967295, 10 digits), its
; kind (0 request, 1 response, 2 stream, 3 consent), its status (0 signed,
; 1 held, 2 denied), the money it moves in minor units (18 digits) and
; when it was signed, in seconds since 1970 (12 digits, to the year 9999).
; Ramble asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps them.
^ZXRAMBLE(id:i10) = kind:i1! ^ status:i1! ^ amount:i18! ^ stamp:i12!
